    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No direct use of AI for learning math recently, but back in vocational school, calculators were common tools. AI could be useful here—like my gardening: digital tools (e.g., plant apps) simplify tasks without replacing my hands-on approach. Math might benefit from AI’s ability to break problems into digestible steps, though I’d prefer analogies over rigid algorithms.",
